---
layout: base.njk
title: Contact
---
<div class="wrap prose">
  <h1>Contact us</h1>
  <p>Send us a message and the office will reply on the next working day. This form sends an email through the lab's own mail server.</p>
  <div class="two">
    <form method="post" action="/contact/send" class="form">
      <label for="name">Your name</label>
      <input id="name" name="name" type="text" maxlength="100" required autocomplete="name">
      <label for="email">Your email address</label>
      <input id="email" name="email" type="email" maxlength="200" required autocomplete="email">
      <label for="phone">Phone (optional)</label>
      <input id="phone" name="phone" type="tel" maxlength="40" autocomplete="tel">
      <label for="message">How can we help?</label>
      <textarea id="message" name="message" rows="6" maxlength="3000" required></textarea>
      <div class="trap" aria-hidden="true"><label for="website">Leave this empty</label><input id="website" name="website" type="text" tabindex="-1" autocomplete="off"></div>
      <button class="button" type="submit">Send message</button>
    </form>
    <aside>
      <h2>Find us</h2>
      <p><strong>Perth head office</strong><br>{{ company.address | join("<br>") | safe }}<br>{{ company.phone }}</p>
      <p>{{ company.hours }}</p>
      <p class="small">All details on this page are invented. See <a href="/about/#fiction">About</a>.</p>
    </aside>
  </div>
</div>
